<title>FRANCE: Rouen April 1-23 grain exports 384,627 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen April 1-23 grain exports 384,627 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exports from Rouen reached 384,627 tonnes between April 1 and April 23, port officials said on Monday.</p>
<p>Grain exports totalled 373,000 tonnes for all of April 1996.</p>
<p>The 384,627 tonne grain total included 292,080 tonnes of wheat, 90,942 tonnes of barley and 1,605 tonnes of maize.</p>
<p>Officials gave the following breakdown by destination (in tonnes).</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>    West Africa		   41,200</p>
<p>    Canary Islands		14,700</p>
<p>    Egypt			   41,500</p>
<p>    Britain			 14,547</p>
<p>    Italy			  152,983</p>
<p>    Morocco			 11,400</p>
<p>    Turkey			  15,750</p>
<p>BARLEY</p>
<p>    Saudi Arabia		  58,917</p>
<p>    Greece			   2,750</p>
<p>    Tunisia			 29,275</p>
<p>MAIZE</p>
<p>    Britain			  1,605</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
